    <p>
      LuxCart partners with trusted global logistics providers to ensure safe,
      insured, and timely delivery of vehicles and accessories worldwide.
    </p>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Domestic Shipping</h5>
    <p>
      Domestic deliveries are handled via enclosed carriers to protect vehicles
