    </p>

    <h5 class="mt-4">International Shipping</h5>
    <p>
      International shipments include export documentation, customs clearance,
      and marine or air freight depending on destination.
    </p>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Estimated Delivery Times</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>Domestic: 5–10 business days</li>
      <li>International: 10–25 business days</li>
    </ul>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Shipping Insurance</h5>
    <p>
      All shipments are fully insured against damage or loss until delivery confirmation.
    </p>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Tracking & Updates</h5>
    <p>
      Tracking information is shared via email once your order is dispatched.
    </p>
  </div>
